# fz: baddy props 11..30 with a mode canary (6.03r7 / Win). Each test: a fresh baddy (own id) in mode 10, which the
# client never reports; then [tested prop][mode 0]. If mode 0 lands, the client walks it and sends C>S 15 x/y for that id.
# Afterwards the baddy is parked (mode 10, far corner) and the player healed.
waitsession 240
wait s2c 9 90
sleep 10
